Tradiion is right up there with "freakin magic" for tired excuses but 
IIRC this behavior goes back at least as far as Hack 1.0.1, where you 
could wear an elven cloak over other body armor (there wasn't a seperate 
cloak type) and scrolls as well acid and such would always effect the 
outer layer.

Puting those two reasons the together: There isn't any particular reason 
for it to work that way, but there isn't any reason it shouldn't either 
(it's magic) and since it's always been that way it might as well be 
considered right (tradition).

